{"4780280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ornament Tower", "steam_appid": 4780280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ornament Tower</strong> is an action-adventure &amp; puzzle game for <strong>up to two</strong> players. The couple of explorers <strong>Azulin</strong> and <strong>Guaraná</strong> were climbing the dangerous canyons that surround the abandoned Ornament Tower when they fell and woke up in its vicinity. Because they got too close to the tower, they were cursed and their bodies transformed into those of animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/82fc9f5d765832031fe89f450d424228.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/82fc9f5d765832031fe89f450d424228.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/82fc9f5d765832031fe89f450d424228.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Created by Lotovik, former Lead Pixel Artist of Fields of Mistria.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/215bf75fa211afb98c63fc22e760641d.avif?t=1787008585\" alt=\"The Ornament Tower Unwelcomes You\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras_big/215bf75fa211afb98c63fc22e760641d.webp?t=1787008585 width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/9c292a3ea8f0f2f906d49e5500ec2af8.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/9c292a3ea8f0f2f906d49e5500ec2af8.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/9c292a3ea8f0f2f906d49e5500ec2af8.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over <strong>120</strong> floors across <strong>5</strong> distinct towers, each with different environments full of challenges, monsters, and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/f6e8f11f691879e6d59523015072e7a4.avif?t=1787008585\" alt=\"Stay Together\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras_big/f6e8f11f691879e6d59523015072e7a4.webp?t=1787008585 width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/c322e5c45349d88dee76b6c765adb10d.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/c322e5c45349d88dee76b6c765adb10d.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/c322e5c45349d88dee76b6c765adb10d.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for this adventure playing with <strong>one or two players</strong>. Cooperation is the key to reaching the top of the tower… and also to each other's <strong>hearts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/df1a0b9a219e7fa1c113fd01b24780a3.avif?t=1787008585\" alt=\"Fight Monsters\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras_big/df1a0b9a219e7fa1c113fd01b24780a3.webp?t=1787008585 width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/b626853f6fc5175c9865e04529dfd5fa.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/b626853f6fc5175c9865e04529dfd5fa.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/b626853f6fc5175c9865e04529dfd5fa.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters together using elements of the environment, or use them to your advantage to solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/462b38428c9260b7358a97a860484aa4.avif?t=1787008585\" alt=\"Solve Enigmas\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras_big/462b38428c9260b7358a97