ras/b626853f6fc5175c9865e04529dfd5fa.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters together using elements of the environment, or use them to your advantage to solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/462b38428c9260b7358a97a860484aa4.avif?t=1787008585\" alt=\"Solve Enigmas\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras_big/462b38428c9260b7358a97a860484aa4.webp?t=1787008585 width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/28cd464ae7973b0f428207efe4bf7dd5.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/28cd464ae7973b0f428207efe4bf7dd5.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/28cd464ae7973b0f428207efe4bf7dd5.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack your brain solving puzzles involving boxes, keys, gates, time, thorns, and all sorts of dangers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/c31c337e106a89d783a563a9d9d629c1.avif?t=1787008585\" alt=\"Reclaim Your Original Body\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras_big/c31c337e106a89d783a563a9d9d629c1.webp?t=1787008585 width=1560 he