bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious, captivating, romantic story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/6de42fe98b1b2d535014078ff8f57695.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/6de42fe98b1b2d535014078ff8f57695.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/6de42fe98b1b2d535014078ff8f57695.mp4?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> and <strong>Follow Us</strong> for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/189e8fb328866d28deb63f34a5e4e17f.poster.avif?t=1787008585\" aria-label=\"Add to your Wishlist and Follow Us\" width=408 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/extras/189e8fb328866d28deb63f34a5e4e17f.webm?t=1787008585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "After getting transformed by a curse for approaching the Ornament Tower, Azulin and Guaraná decide to climb it together in order to recover their original bodies. Solve puzzles, defeat enemies and reach out to each other's hearts in this Action-Puzzle adventure.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780280/154570426a5020fca1c18b7b1341f6daf8383890/header.jpg?t=1787008585", "capsule_image": "h